'check moment' with "the empty text" and 0 and {'the moment read from' of ""}.
'check moment' with "a date that does not exist is refused, not normalised" and 0 and {'the moment read from' of "2026-02-30"}.
'check moment' with "trailing garbage after a valid date is refused" and 0 and {'the moment read from' of "2026-07-29 extra"}.
a boolean called 'a valid date reads as a moment' is 'reads as a moment' of "2026-07-29".
