a boolean called 'trailing garbage does not read as a moment' is 'reads as a moment' of "2026-07-29 extra".
check with "trailing garbage does not read as a moment" and "0" and "{'trailing garbage does not read as a moment'}".

Print "-- relative descriptions --".
(a Sunday, so the weekday items below have a base that is itself sunday)
a number called 'the base moment' is {'the moment at' with 2026 and 9 and 27 and 12 and 0 and 0}.
'check moment' with "now" and 'the base moment' and {'the moment described by' of "now" and 'the base moment'}.
'check moment' with "today (midnight)" and {'the start of the day of' of 'the base moment'} and {'the moment described by' of "today" and 'the base moment'}.
